      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are carrying too many items. Come back after taking off some of them.",
      "translation" : "你带的物品太多了。拿出一些物品后再回来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are carrying too much weight. Come back after reducing the weight.",
      "translation" : "你的负重太高了。减轻负重后再回来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hey. This is too dangerous a place for you. You cannot keep yourself safe. Get out of here and go to the village right now!",
      "translation" : "嘿，这里太危险了，你保护不了自己。快离开这里，马上回村子去！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We are gonna be killed all by that Bakonawa. Ah, we must slay him but unfortunately we are not prepared.",
      "translation" : "我们会被巴科纳瓦杀光的。唉，我们必须杀了它，可惜现在还没准备好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Isn't there any company who can go with you? Or even if you wanna go alone, come after organizing a party.",
      "translation" : "没有其他人能和你一起去吗？即使你想独自前往，也先组好队再来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you the leader of the Bakonawa slayers? The road is not well so we have to go down the cliff with a rope, is that OK?",
      "translation" : "你是讨伐巴科纳瓦的队长吗？这条路不好走，我们得用绳子下悬崖，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please weave a rope.",
      "translation" : "请编一条绳子。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now I will go down.",
      "translation" : "我现在下去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel.",
      "translation" : "取消。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You came for slaying Bakonawa. The leader of your party has to help me weaving the rope for going down.",
      "translation" : "你是来讨伐巴科纳瓦的吧。你的队长必须帮我编好下悬崖用的绳子。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now I will go down.",
      "translation" : "我现在下去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel.",
      "translation" : "取消。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, the rope got dropped. I have to make a new one.",
      "translation" : "哦，绳子掉下去了。我得重新编一条。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now I'm weaving, so you can go down when I'm done.",
      "translation" : "我正在编绳子，弄好后你就可以下去了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
