      "npc" : "Bakonawa's Rage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Bakonawa's Rage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My name is Minky.",
      "translation" : "我叫明基。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Heehee, I could join the Bakonawa hunt, but I'd rather hide behind that rock and cheer you guys on.",
      "translation" : "嘿嘿，我也能参加讨伐巴科纳瓦，不过我更想躲在那块岩石后面给你们加油。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Bakonawa becomes invincible at some point. When that time comes, listen to my guides carefully. Just trust me and all will be good.",
      "translation" : "巴科纳瓦有时会变得无敌。到时候仔细听我的指示。相信我，一切都会顺利的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now I will make Bakonawa spring out from the lake.",
      "translation" : "现在我就把巴科纳瓦从湖里引出来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hold on! I'm not ready yet!",
      "translation" : "等一下！我还没准备好！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's do it!",
      "translation" : "开始吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... alright... tell me when you are ready.",
      "translation" : "哦...好吧...准备好后告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then I will drop a drop of Albopal to this lake.",
      "translation" : "那么，我要往湖里滴一滴阿尔波帕尔。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Once Bakonawa tastes this, he will surface...",
      "translation" : "巴科纳瓦尝到这个之后，就会浮出水面..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am dropping the Alpopal to make Bakonawa mad. Bakonawa can be a good source of protein once we get him.",
      "translation" : "我把阿尔波帕尔滴进湖里，让巴科纳瓦发怒。抓到它后，它可是很好的蛋白质来源。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 471,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems you are carrying too many different kinds of items. Please try again after reducing it.",
      "translation" : "你似乎带了太多种类的物品。减少一些后再试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 475,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems you are already carrying items of too much weight. Please try again after reducing the weight.",
      "translation" : "你似乎带了过重的物品。减轻负重后再试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 480,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 481,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This was found from Bakonawa's corpse. It would be better if you take this.",
      "translation" : "这是从巴科纳瓦的尸体上找到的。你最好拿着。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 489,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 490,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We better hurry and get out of this place. This place is still dangerous even without Bakonawa...",
      "translation" : "我们最好赶快离开这里。即使没有巴科纳瓦，这里也仍然很危险..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 492,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 493,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then let's use to the rope to go up!",
      "translation" : "那么，我们用绳子爬上去吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 514,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 515,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "HMM. We almost got him but he is one fast creature...",
      "translation" : "嗯，我们差点就抓住它了，可它动作真快..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 518,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 519,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are we going to try again?",
      "translation" : "我们要再试一次吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 521,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hold on a sec!",
      "translation" : "等一下！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 521,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Of course! We cannot stand back now!",
      "translation" : "当然！我们不能就此放弃！"
